    "detailed_description": "Arcanatica is a brand new multiplayer survival action game with elements of magic. <br>The game combines many different mechanics, such as survival, hunting, building, crafting, and others, along with elements of magic.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><li><strong>Choose your hero!</strong><br>You can choose the gender, hairstyle... for your character!<br></li><li><strong>Multiplayer</strong><br>Play with friends and more!<br>It already contains all the usual elements (kill, steal items from a corpse, etc...).<br></li><li><strong>Fighting</strong><br>with bare hands!<br></li><li><strong>Survival &amp; Magic</strong><br>Health, Mana, Thirst, Hunger, -&gt; Death<br></li><li><strong>Magic</strong></li></ul><br>In order to use magic, you need to have a special stone that contains concentrated magical energy in a certain flow, which will allow you to use the magic stored in this stone.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Magic</h2><li><strong>1. Throw a stone</strong><br>This begins the game's evolution, with this magic you will be able to deal remote damage to another player and start mining resources!</li></ul>",
